#: main.cpp:17 mainwindow.cpp:12
msgid "NVIDIA Driver Manager"
msgstr "NVIDIA 驱动程序管理器"

#: main.cpp:19
msgid "Manage NVIDIA drivers on Fedora Linux"
msgstr "在 Fedora Linux 上管理 NVIDIA 驱动程序"

#: main.cpp:21
msgid "(c) 2025 Your Name"
msgstr "(C) 2027 KairikiFeedora"

#: mainwindow.cpp:20
msgid "Detecting GPU..."
msgstr "正在检测 GPU..."

#: mainwindow.cpp:24
msgid "Current driver: detecting..."
msgstr "当前驱动程序：正在检测..."

#: mainwindow.cpp:28
msgid "Select Driver Version"
msgstr "选择驱动程序版本"

#: mainwindow.cpp:38
msgid "Install / Switch Driver"
msgstr "安装 / 切换驱动程序"

#: mainwindow.cpp:54
msgid "NVIDIA GPU detected ✓"
msgstr "检测到 NVIDIA GPU ✓"

#: mainwindow.cpp:59
msgid "This computer does not need additional drivers."
msgstr "此计算机无需额外驱动程序。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:67
msgid "Current driver: not installed"
msgstr "当前驱动程序：未安装"

#: mainwindow.cpp:69
msgid "Current driver: %1"
msgstr "当前驱动程序：%1"

#: mainwindow.cpp:95
msgid "Authentication Required"
msgstr "需要身份验证"

#: mainwindow.cpp:96
msgid ""
"Administrator privileges are required to install drivers.\n"
"Operation cancelled."
msgstr ""
"安装驱动程序需要管理员权限。\n"
"操作已取消。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:104
msgid "Confirm Installation"
msgstr "确认安装"

#: mainwindow.cpp:105
msgid ""
"The system will install/switch to %1.\n"
"\n"
"This requires root privileges and may download packages. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"系统将安装/切换至 %1。\n"
"\n"
"此操作需要 root 权限，并可能下载软件包。是否继续？"

#: mainwindow.cpp:115
msgid "Success"
msgstr "成功"

#: mainwindow.cpp:116
msgid ""
"Driver installed successfully.\n"
"Please reboot to apply changes."
msgstr ""
"驱动程序安装成功。\n"
"请重启以应用更改。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:119
msgid "Error"
msgstr "错误"

#: mainwindow.cpp:120
msgid ""
"Driver installation failed.\n"
"Check terminal output for details."
msgstr ""
"驱动程序安装失败。\n"
"请查看终端输出以获取详细信息。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:133
msgid "Secure Boot Detected"
msgstr "检测到安全启动"

#: mainwindow.cpp:134
msgid ""
"Secure Boot is enabled on this system.\n"
"NVIDIA drivers must be signed to load.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to configure Machine Owner Key (MOK) now?"
msgstr ""
"此系统已启用安全启动。\n"
"NVIDIA 驱动程序必须经过签名才能加载。\n"
"\n"
"是否现在配置机器所有者密钥（MOK）？"

#: mainwindow.cpp:138
msgid "Configure MOK"
msgstr "配置 MOK"

#: mainwindow.cpp:139
msgid "Skip (Install anyway)"
msgstr "跳过（仍安装）"

#: mainwindow.cpp:149
msgid "MOK Configuration Failed"
msgstr "MOK 配置失败"

#: mainwindow.cpp:150
msgid ""
"Failed to set up MOK. You can still install the driver, but it may not load "
"with Secure Boot enabled."
msgstr ""
"设置 MOK 失败。您仍可安装驱动程序，但在启用安全启动的情况下可能无法加载。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:155
msgid "MOK Configured"
msgstr "MOK 已配置"

#: mainwindow.cpp:156
msgid ""
"The Machine Owner Key has been imported successfully.\n"
"\n"
"When you reboot, the MOK management interface will appear.\n"
"Select 'Enroll MOK' -> 'Continue' -> 'Yes' and enter the password:\n"
"    nvidia-mok\n"
"\n"
"After enrolling, the driver will load correctly."
msgstr ""
"机器所有者密钥已成功导入。\n"
"\n"
"重启后，将出现 MOK 管理界面。\n"
"请选择“Enroll MOK”->“Continue”->“Yes”，然后输入密码：\n"
"    nvidia-mok\n"
"\n"
"注册后，驱动程序将正常加载。"
